---
// 关于 Laity
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>关于 Laity | Laity Studio</title>
		<style>
			/* 基础重置与全局样式 */
			* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
			body {
				background-color: #0a0a0a;
				color: #f4f4f5;
				font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
				line-height: 1.6;
				padding: 2rem 1rem;
				display: flex;
				justify-content: center;
			}
			.container { max-width: 1000px; width: 100%; }

			/* 头部区 */
			header { margin-bottom: 4rem; margin-top: 4rem; text-align: center; }
			h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.highlight { color: #fbbf24; }
			.subtitle { font-size: 1.25rem; color: #a1a1aa; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }

			/* 正文区 */
			main { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
			.lead { font-size: 1.125rem; color: #d4d4d8; line-height: 1.8; }

			/* 页脚 */
			footer { margin-top: 5rem; text-align: center; color: #52525b; font-size: 0.875rem; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid #27272a; }
			footer a { color: #a1a1aa; text-decoration: none; }
			footer a:hover { color: #f4f4f5; }
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="container">

			<header>
				<h1>关于 <span class="highlight">Laity</span></h1>
				<p class="subtitle">外行造世界</p>
			</header>

			<main>
				<p class="lead">Laity Studio 是一个<span class="highlight">独立开发厂牌</span>，致力于利用 AI 和现代 Web 技术，将想法直接转化为上线作品。</p>
			</main>

			<footer>
				<a href="/">← 返回 Laity 母舰</a>
			</footer>

		</div>
	</body>
</html>
